WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.433 --> 00:00:13.939
It was a busy day in downtown Metro City.

2
00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:17.141
People hurried along the sidewalk.

3
00:00:18.561 --> 00:00:22.404
Cars and buses filled West Street.

4
00:00:22.524 --> 00:00:23.965
Rumble! Rumble!

5
00:00:25.205 --> 00:00:26.346
Suddenly the ground shook.

6
00:00:26.366 --> 00:00:29.568
"Earthquake!" a woman shouted.

7
00:00:30.996 --> 00:00:32.597
A large shadow fell over the street.

8
00:00:33.677 --> 00:00:34.417
Everyone looked up.

9
00:00:35.957 --> 00:00:36.638
A man gulped.

10
00:00:36.658 --> 00:00:39.779
"W-what is that?"

11
00:00:42.479 --> 00:00:43.680
Jack had a new Frisbee.

12
00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:47.281
Roxy and her friends were playing with it in Mara's backyard.

13
00:00:47.301 --> 00:00:50.061
"Hey, Mara, catch!"

14
00:00:50.281 --> 00:00:50.882
yelled Jack.

15
00:00:51.762 --> 00:00:52.682
He threw the Frisbee.

16
00:00:53.382 --> 00:00:54.763
Mara ran fast to catch it.

17
00:00:54.783 --> 00:00:55.843
"Got it!"

18
00:00:55.863 --> 00:00:58.204
"Throw it over here!"

19
00:00:58.424 --> 00:00:59.104
called Terrell.

20
00:01:01.368 --> 00:01:03.569
Terrell caught the Frisbee and then threw it to Roxy.

21
00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:07.070
She caught it and then threw it to Jack.

22
00:01:09.532 --> 00:01:11.132
Jack fanned himself with the Frisbee.

23
00:01:11.152 --> 00:01:14.954
"It's so hot today," he said.

24
00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:17.135
"I wish we could go swimming."

25
00:01:17.155 --> 00:01:21.657
"I asked my mom to take us to the city pool," said Mara.

26
00:01:21.677 --> 00:01:24.738
"But she has too much work to do today."

27
00:01:24.758 --> 00:01:29.380
"It's too bad we can't go to the new water park," said Terrell.

28
00:01:30.184 --> 00:01:33.687
"It's got water slides and a really cool wave machine.

29
00:01:34.748 --> 00:01:36.749
That's even better than a pool!"

30
00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:38.771
Mara shrugged.

31
00:01:38.791 --> 00:01:41.833
"We can't do anything about the heat," she said.

32
00:01:41.854 --> 00:01:44.356
"So let's just keep playing Frisbee.

33
00:01:48.078 --> 00:01:49.440
Here, Roxy, catch!"

34
00:01:51.121 --> 00:01:52.282
Roxy caught the Frisbee.

35
00:01:53.143 --> 00:01:54.524
Then she flung it toward Terrell.

36
00:01:57.026 --> 00:01:58.987
"Oops! Sorry about that, Terrell!"

37
00:01:59.247 --> 00:01:59.708
she called.

38
00:02:00.524 --> 00:02:01.805
"That was a bad throw."

39
00:02:02.606 --> 00:02:04.127
Terrell chased after the Frisbee.

40
00:02:05.088 --> 00:02:07.290
But he couldn't grab it before it sailed over the fence.

41
00:02:11.053 --> 00:02:12.574
It dropped into a neighbor's backyard.

42
00:02:12.594 --> 00:02:16.317
"My new Frisbee!"

43
00:02:16.697 --> 00:02:17.258
said Jack.

44
00:02:17.278 --> 00:02:19.940
"I'll get it," said Terrell.

45
00:02:20.801 --> 00:02:21.922
He climbed over the fence.

46
00:02:23.403 --> 00:02:25.725
He was back a few minutes later, carrying the Frisbee.

47
00:02:27.006 --> 00:02:28.327
Sweat dripped down his forehead.

48
00:02:30.192 --> 00:02:32.694
"Now I'm really hot," he complained.

49
00:02:32.714 --> 00:02:36.096
"I wish Rocket Girl was here.

50
00:02:37.297 --> 00:02:41.040
She could probably make it rain or even snow, to cool us off."

51
00:02:42.601 --> 00:02:43.262
Roxy grinned.

52
00:02:43.922 --> 00:02:46.864
"Yeah, Rocket Girl could definitely do that."

53
00:02:46.884 --> 00:02:49.046
"You think so?"

54
00:02:49.346 --> 00:02:50.447
Terrell looked hopeful.

55
00:02:50.467 --> 00:02:52.929
"Nope," said Roxy.

56
00:02:52.949 --> 00:02:56.992
"Rocket Girl is powerful, but she can't change the weather.

57
00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:00.782
Besides, she has more important things to do."

58
00:03:00.802 --> 00:03:03.204
"You're right, Roxy."

59
00:03:04.065 --> 00:03:06.286
Terrell frowned and tossed the Frisbee to Jack.

60
00:03:07.527 --> 00:03:09.208
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

61
00:03:09.228 --> 00:03:13.251
"I'll be right back," she said.

62
00:03:15.953 --> 00:03:17.554
Roxy hurried into Mara's house.

63
00:03:18.775 --> 00:03:20.036
She flipped open her watch.

64
00:03:21.397 --> 00:03:22.738
Mayor Bloom's face appeared.

65
00:03:23.839 --> 00:03:25.040
He looked very worried.

66
00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:27.962
"Mayor Bloom," said Roxy.

67
00:03:27.982 --> 00:03:29.423
"What's wrong?"

68
00:03:30.403 --> 00:03:32.725
"We need your help, Rocket Girl," said the mayor.

69
00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:36.328
"A giant monster is destroying Metro City!"

70
00:03:36.348 --> 00:03:39.190
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

71
00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:41.112
"I'm on my way!"
